            "category": "trilium-documentation",
            "description": "The user wants Copilot to inspect existing Trilium notes, synthesize new material, and create one or more notes inside a Trilium subtree.",
            "examples": [
              "Write documentation on how to build a local AI and add it to my Homelab section",
              "Use my Trilium notes to create a docs tree under Infrastructure for local LLM hosting",
              "Summarize these homelab notes and turn them into a cleaner documentation set in Trilium"
